WEBVTT

00:00:07.498 --> 00:00:10.633
<v><b>David:</b></v> I arrived at the Royal Albert Hall at seven o’clock.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.128
I got the tickets, and I waited in the bar.

00:00:18.805 --> 00:00:20.447
But Olivia didn’t arrive.

00:00:23.562 --> 00:00:27.032
I looked at my watch. It was seven forty-five.

00:00:31.228 --> 00:00:34.028
I looked at my phone. There was a message.

00:00:34.973 --> 00:00:37.297
<v><b>Olivia:</b></v> Sorry! In a meeting.

00:00:38.036 --> 00:00:40.226
Leave my ticket at the box office.

00:00:58.616 --> 00:01:03.013
<v><b>David:</b></v> I left her ticket at the box office and went to my seat.

00:01:12.493 --> 00:01:16.851
The concert started, but Olivia didn’t arrive.

00:01:44.683 --> 00:01:47.168
When the concert finished, I phoned her,

00:01:48.544 --> 00:01:49.995
but her phone was off.

00:01:52.121 --> 00:01:55.132
<v><b>W:</b></v> The number you are dialling is currently unavailable.

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:00.415
<v><b>David:</b></v> I sent her a text:

00:02:04.028 --> 00:02:04.970
Where are you?

00:02:09.611 --> 00:02:10.911
I was very angry.

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:14.150
I left the concert hall and went home.

00:02:19.351 --> 00:02:22.620
I opened the door of my flat and turned on the light…